  "prefLabel": "Puc 3002.08 Sanctionable event",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 3002.08 “Sanctionable event” means a CNGS or aggregator has:\n\n(a) Violated any provision of the rules included in this chapter or in En 3000;\n\n(b) Violated the requirements of RSA 12-P:15, I or any other provision of RSA Title XXXIV applicable to CNGS or aggregators; or\n\n(c) Engaged in any unfair or deceptive acts or practices in the marketing, sale, or solicitation of natural gas or related services.\n\nSource. #12757, eff 6-1-19; ss by #14613, eff 6-5-26, EXPIRES: 6-5-36 (formerly Puc 3002.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc3000.html"
